Banshee

![[BANSHEE.gif]]

|  |  |
| --- | --- |
| **CLIMATE/TERRAIN:** | Any |
| **FREQUENCY:** | Very rare |
| **ORGANIZATION:** | Solitary |
| **ACTIVITY CYCLE:** | Night |
| **DIET:** | Nil |
| **INTELLIGENCE:** | Exceptional (15-16) |
| **TREASURE:** | (D) |
| **ALIGNMENT:** | Chaotic evil |
| **NO. APPEARING:** | 1 |
| **ARMOR CLASS:** | 0 |
| **MOVEMENT:** | 15 |
| **HIT DICE:** | 7 |
| **THAC0:** | 13 |
| **NO. OF ATTACKS:** | 1 |
